/12236"} "Uli Kirchhoff"] " was the only rider with clean rides in both rounds, although he incurred 1.00 time penalties in the second round, but this still brought him the gold medal."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The other medals involved a complicated seven-way tie for second and a seven-rider jump-off. In the jump-off Switzerland’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/12409"} "Willi Melliger"] " and France’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/11389"} "Alexandra Ledermann"] " both had clean rides, the only two of the jump-off, with Melliger winning the silver medal on time, 38.07 to 41.46."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Within three weeks, Kirchhoff’s horse, " [:a {:href "/horses/1295"} "Jus de Pommes"] " would tragically die from circulatory collapse after a severe intestinal disorder."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "Horse"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Qualifying"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "344"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12236"} "Uli Kirchhoff"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/1295"} "Jus de Pommes"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "5.50 (5)"] [:td {} "1.00 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "720"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12409"} "Willi Melliger"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/370"} "Calvaro V"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SUI"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SUI.png"}] "SUI"]] [:td {} "16.00 (=16)"] [:td {} "4.00 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "320"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athlet